  <ThingDef ParentName="Crimson_RecreationFurnitureBase">
    <defName>Crimson_PokerTable</defName>
    <label>심홍 포커 테이블</label>
    <description>진홍색 가장자리 조명을 갖춘 함선용 포커 테이블입니다. 주변에 의자를 놓으면 원래 포커 놀이 동작으로 사용할 수 있습니다. 표시등과 약한 주변 조명에 50W를 사용하며 전원이 공급되는 동안 놀이를 시작할 수 있습니다.</description>
    <size>(1,1)</size>
    <graphicData><texPath>Crimson/Decor/Recreation/PokerTableV44States</texPath><drawSize>(1,1)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>1750</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>10000</WorkToBuild><Mass>30</Mass><JoyGainFactor>1.3</JoyGainFactor><Beauty>80</Beauty><MarketValue>9732.4</MarketValue><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <building><joyKind>Gaming_Cerebral</joyKind><buildingSizeCategory>Small</buildingSizeCategory></building>
    <costList Inherit="False"><Steel>80</Steel><Plasteel>15</Plasteel><ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
    <comps><li Class="CompProperties_Power"><compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass><basePowerConsumption>50</basePowerConsumption><transmitsPower>false</transmitsPower></li><li Class="CrimsonSOS2.CompProperties_CrimsonFixedFurniture"><originalMaxHitPoints>250</originalMaxHitPoints></li></comps>
    <uiOrder>1000</uiOrder>
      <stuffCategories Inherit="False" />
      <costStuffCount>0</costStuffCount>
      <defaultStuff IsNull="True" />
    <designationCategory>Joy</designationCategory>
    <designatorDropdown>Crimson_RecreationFurniture</designatorDropdown>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="Crimson_RecreationFurnitureBase">
    <defName>Crimson_BilliardsTable</defName>
    <label>심홍 당구대</label>
    <description>검은 외피와 진홍색 포켓 표시를 갖춘 함선용 당구대입니다. 주변 가장자리에 이동할 공간을 남겨야 합니다. 원래 당구 놀이 동작과 사격 기술 훈련을 사용하며 기본 오락 충족 계수는 130%입니다. 표시등과 약한 주변 조명에 80W를 사용하며 전원이 공급되는 동안 놀이를 시작할 수 있습니다.</description>
    <size>(2,3)</size>
    <graphicData><texPath>Crimson/Decor/Recreation/BilliardsTableStates</texPath><drawSize>(2,3)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>2100</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>12000</WorkToBuild><Mass>60</Mass><JoyGainFactor>1.3</JoyGainFactor><Beauty>80</Beauty><MarketValue>15338.88</MarketValue><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <building><joyKind>Gaming_Dexterity</joyKind><buildingSizeCategory>Medium</buildingSizeCategory></building>
    <costList Inherit="False"><Steel>120</Steel><Plasteel>30</Plasteel><ComponentIndustrial>3</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
    <comps><li Class="CompProperties_Power"><compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass><basePowerConsumption>80</basePowerConsumption><transmitsPower>false</transmitsPower></li><li Class="CrimsonSOS2.CompProperties_CrimsonFixedFurniture"><originalMaxHitPoints>300</originalMaxHitPoints></li></comps>
    <placeWorkers><li>PlaceWorker_NeverAdjacentUnstandable</li></placeWorkers>
    <uiOrder>1001</uiOrder>
      <stuffCategories Inherit="False" />
      <costStuffCount>0</costStuffCount>
      <defaultStuff IsNull="True" />
    <designationCategory>Joy</designationCategory>
    <designatorDropdown>Crimson_RecreationFurniture</designatorDropdown>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="Crimson_RecreationFurnitureBase">
    <defName>Crimson_ChessTable</defName>
    <label>심홍 체스 테이블</label>
    <description>진홍색 경계 조명과 검은 말판을 갖춘 체스 테이블입니다. 주변에 의자를 놓으면 한 명 또는 두 명이 원래 체스 놀이 동작으로 지능 기술을 훈련할 수 있습니다. 표시등과 약한 주변 조명에 30W를 사용하며 전원이 공급되는 동안 놀이를 시작할 수 있습니다.</description>
    <size>(1,1)</size>
    <graphicData><texPath>Crimson/Decor/Recreation/ChessTableStates</texPath><drawSize>(1,1)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>1120</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>8000</WorkToBuild><Mass>12</Mass><JoyGainFactor>1</JoyGainFactor><Beauty>80</Beauty><MarketValue>6125.92</MarketValue><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <building><joyKind>Gaming_Cerebral</joyKind></building>
    <costList Inherit="False"><Steel>50</Steel><Plasteel>10</Plasteel><ComponentIndustrial>1</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
    <comps><li Class="CompProperties_Power"><compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass><basePowerConsumption>30</basePowerConsumption><transmitsPower>false</transmitsPower></li><li Class="CrimsonSOS2.CompProperties_CrimsonFixedFurniture"><originalMaxHitPoints>160</originalMaxHitPoints></li></comps>
    <uiOrder>1002</uiOrder>
      <stuffCategories Inherit="False" />
      <costStuffCount>0</costStuffCount>
      <defaultStuff IsNull="True" />
    <designationCategory>Joy</designationCategory>
    <designatorDropdown>Crimson_RecreationFurniture</designatorDropdown>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="Crimson_RecreationFurnitureBase">
    <defName>Crimson_LargeTelevision</defName>
    <label>심홍 대형 텔레비전</label>
    <description>세 칸 너비의 벽에 부착하는 함선용 대형 텔레비전입니다. 바닥 받침대 없이 벽면에 설치하며 전원이 공급되면 앞쪽 2~7칸의 시청 구역에서 영상을 볼 수 있습니다. 같은 방의 의자와 침대에서도 기본 TV 시청 동작을 사용할 수 있으며 소비전력은 4500W입니다. 재료와 등급 선택 없이 기존 심홍 가구의 고정 수치를 사용합니다.</description>
    <size>(3,1)</size>
    <defaultPlacingRot>North</defaultPlacingRot>
    <graphicData><texPath>Crimson/Decor/Recreation/LargeTelevisionWallStates</texPath><graphicClass>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonV51FurnitureGraphic</graphicClass><drawSize>(3,1)</drawSize><drawOffsetNorth>(0,0,0.65)</drawOffsetNorth><drawOffsetSouth>(0,0,-0.65)</drawOffsetSouth><drawOffsetEast>(0.65,0,0)</drawOffsetEast><drawOffsetWest>(-0.65,0,0)</drawOffsetWest></graphicData>
    <altitudeLayer>BuildingOnTop</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>Standable</passability><pathCost>0</pathCost><fillPercent>0.15</fillPercent>
    <blockLight>false</blockLight><clearBuildingArea>false</clearBuildingArea>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded IsNull="True" />
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>1120</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>80000</WorkToBuild><Mass>25</Mass><JoyGainFactor>1.6</JoyGainFactor><Beauty>80</Beauty><MarketValue>23259.2</MarketValue><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <building><joyKind>Television</joyKind><watchBuildingStandDistanceRange>2~7</watchBuildingStandDistanceRange><watchBuildingStandRectWidth>7</watchBuildingStandRectWidth><watchBuildingInSameRoom>true</watchBuildingInSameRoom><effectWatching>WatchingTelevision</effectWatching><spawnedConceptLearnOpportunity>TVForSickPeople</spawnedConceptLearnOpportunity><boughtConceptLearnOpportunity>TVForSickPeople</boughtConceptLearnOpportunity><isEdifice>false</isEdifice><isAttachment>true</isAttachment></building>
    <costList Inherit="False"><Steel>180</Steel><Plasteel>40</Plasteel><ComponentIndustrial>10</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
    <comps><li Class="CompProperties_Power"><compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass><basePowerConsumption>4500</basePowerConsumption><transmitsPower>false</transmitsPower><shortCircuitInRain>true</shortCircuitInRain></li><li Class="CrimsonSOS2.CompProperties_CrimsonFixedFurniture"><originalMaxHitPoints>160</originalMaxHitPoints></li></comps>
    <researchPrerequisites Inherit="False"><li>FlatscreenTelevision</li></researchPrerequisites>
    <constructionSkillPrerequisite>8</constructionSkillPrerequisite>
    <drawPlaceWorkersWhileSelected>true</drawPlaceWorkersWhileSelected>
    <placeWorkers><li>PlaceWorker_WatchArea</li><li>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonFurnitureWallPlaceWorker</li></placeWorkers>
    <uiOrder>1003</uiOrder>
      <stuffCategories Inherit="False" />
      <costStuffCount>0</costStuffCount>
      <defaultStuff IsNull="True" />
    <designationCategory>Joy</designationCategory>
    <designatorDropdown>Crimson_RecreationFurniture</designatorDropdown>
  </ThingDef>

